---
name: csv-audit
description: "Use when the user asks to 'audit this CSV', 'check the export', 'why does the file have blank rows', or hands over a delimited export to vet before it is loaded. NEGATIVE ROUTING: building or merging a dataset is /ds."
---

# CSV Audit

Reads one delimited export and reports what would break a load.

## Step 1: Inventory

Run `bun ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/inventory.ts <file>` and read its column table.

## Step 2: Report

List each defect with its row number.

## Background

This skill was originally written in March, after we spent a long afternoon on a vendor export that
would not load. At first the team tried a few different approaches, and over time the design evolved
into the two steps below. Previously the skill also had a third step, which some people liked, but it
was removed in a later cleanup. The current shape has worked well for everyone so far.
